local module = {}

-- Ped flags. The names are the game's own (CPED_CONFIG_FLAG_* and CPED_RESET_FLAG_*, without the prefix) in
-- UPPER_SNAKE_CASE, the numbers are what SET/GET_PED_CONFIG_FLAG and SET/GET_PED_RESET_FLAG take.
-- The flags are grouped by what they are about (ragdoll, fall, movement, vehicles, ...) and sorted by name inside a
-- group, not by number: to find one, look for a word of its name.
--
-- The comments are Rockstar's own descriptions from the community dump BUZZARDGTA/v_ped_stuff, some cut short. Without
-- one the comment ends with (name only): read off the name, nothing else is known; (unknown): nothing is known at all.
-- [fall], [ragdoll] and [move] mark the flags that matter for a fall, a ragdoll or the control of the ped's movement.
-- None of them was tried in the game unless a comment says so

-- Config flags: stay set until changed (SET/GET_PED_CONFIG_FLAG)

